{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c14ffceda680fcaf21bbb8d6f3e9602b26baacb8dff89d3c6368b481d5ad96e0","ja":"「はぁ……まさか私が、あなたたち月兎隊と\n協力することになるなんて……」","zh":"「唉……没想到我竟然会和你月兎队\n合作……」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"28cb48a1e1243b55054c240b8b42d5349ec7e4c65feba52e94df10cd902c05e1","ja":"「悪くない取引だと思うけど？\n立場は違えど、追う獲物は同じなんだから」","zh":"我觉得这交易不坏吧？\n虽然立场不同，但我们追的是同一个猎物","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"574bebe1a6ac7ad67ef120e9f381c3d9593b580626672eaea45033066c7b2d56","ja":"「あなたの獲物は『おから』でしょ！」","zh":"你的猎物是『豆渣』吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c668df5af465bb8e699223ca9defad14005b5bcb265f6cf91c98a57d9c49fa3f","ja":"未来さんストップ！\nそこは『おから』じゃなくて『お宝』！","zh":"未来同学，停下！\n那里不是『豆渣』，是『宝物』！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dfa297b9a12ff048a5ba5cd40a2616bb4b57d1e625b2e1c742b103a570e138e7","ja":"そ、そうだった……！　またミスしちゃった……。\nこれで何回目だっけ……。","zh":"对、对哦……！　又失误了……。\n这都第几次了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6ae63d8bd5aac611f457f270aafeb6d38dfd2c42888b26c90c4a29c0d3bf4df5","ja":"うーん。台本読みしていくうちに\n息も合うかと思ったけど……イマイチだね。","zh":"嗯。读剧本的时候我还以为\n我们能配合默契……但还不太行呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ac0b914572ddfd02ab2f9dce91b95899128e808e09668884fdebc16a74baf6fc","ja":"せっかく、DVD特典のスピンオフドラマなのに……\nううっ。集中も切れてきちゃったし……。","zh":"明明是DVD特典的衍生剧……\n呜呜。注意力也开始涣散了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7f8426d4130e4939c829d846c9342ee865a5bf829e40ddf39f433b04c24cd855","ja":"じゃあ、ちょっと練習場所を変えてみるとか。\nせっかくだし桃子もついて……。","zh":"那么，就稍微换个练习场所吧。\n难得有机会，桃子也一起来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"126dfa62a1fecad1ca9cd9b4b946a4d798e75a5829094c195f910f3da57414ab","ja":"そっかぁ！　さすが桃子ちゃん！\nじゃあ外で練習して、流れ覚えてくるね！","zh":"原来如此！真不愧是桃子！\n那我去外面练习，熟悉一下流程再回来吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_936.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b3b2eeff0daeca93f00fda4bad705ba80e81a66840dfb71207b1e9492d9517d0","ja":"え……。\nまだ話の途中……。","zh":"诶……。\n话还没说完……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
